{"name":"Kiwiana","title":"Kiwiana","revision":219289,"url":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/Kiwiana","retrieved":"2026-09-06","license":"CC BY-SA","licenseUrl":"https://www.fandom.com/licensing","language":"en","blocks":[{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Kiwiana is a term referring to the culture, heritage of New Zealand predominantly from the 20th century that are iconic and exclusive to New Zealand. The term Kiwiana refers to the Kiwi, the national bird of New Zealand and the nickname of New Zealand peoples. The term is also used to describe any and all New Zealand icons, pop culture items such as toys or branded foods; national icons of New Zealand have become Kiwiana. These include the kiwi and the hei-tiki."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Visuals"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Under construction."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Fashion"},{"kind":"list","text":"Rugby jerseys"},{"kind":"list","text":"Fleece jackets"},{"kind":"list","text":"Wool or merino sweaters"},{"kind":"list","text":"Swanndri or similar bush shirts"},{"kind":"list","text":"Weatherproof jackets"},{"kind":"list","text":"Gumboots"},{"kind":"list","text":"Jandals (flip-flops)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Cargo shorts or practical trousers"},{"kind":"list","text":"Plain T-shirts or singlets"},{"kind":"list","text":"Beanies"},{"kind":"list","text":"Baseball caps"},{"kind":"list","text":"Puffer vests"},{"kind":"list","text":"Wool socks"},{"kind":"list","text":"Clothing featuring silver ferns or kiwi motifs"},{"kind":"list","text":"Simple backpacks or outdoor packs"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Media"},{"kind":"list","text":"The Billy T. James Show"},{"kind":"list","text":"Bumble"},{"kind":"list","text":"Country Calendar"},{"kind":"list","text":"McDonald's Young Entertainers"},{"kind":"list","text":"The Moe Show"},{"kind":"list","text":"Oscar and Friends"},{"kind":"list","text":"Outrageous Fortune"},{"kind":"list","text":"Shortland Street"},{"kind":"list","text":"The Son of a Gunn Show"},{"kind":"list","text":"What Now?"},{"kind":"list","text":"Wellington Paranormal"},{"kind":"list","text":"You and Me"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Movies"},{"kind":"list","text":"Boy"},{"kind":"list","text":"Heavenly Creatures"},{"kind":"list","text":"Hunt for the Wilderpeople"},{"kind":"list","text":"Goodbye Pork Pie"},{"kind":"list","text":"Once Were Warriors"},{"kind":"list","text":"The Piano"},{"kind":"list","text":"Scarfies"},{"kind":"list","text":"Whale Rider"},{"kind":"list","text":"What We Do in the Shadows"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Music"},{"kind":"list","text":"\"The Gumboot Song\" by Fred Dagg"},{"kind":"list","text":"\"Poi E\" by Pātea Māori Club"},{"kind":"list","text":"\"Slice of Heaven\" by Dave Dobbyn"}],"contentStatus":"full-source","images":[{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/3/3e/Kiwiana.png/revision/latest?cb=20231027154536","caption":"Kiwiana · Visual reference 01","source":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/File:Kiwiana.png","remote":true,"local":"images/detail/0559-1.webp","localAvailable":true},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/6/61/The_longest_drink_in_town.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20241028175115","caption":"Kiwiana · Visual reference 02","source":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/File:The_longest_drink_in_town.jpg","remote":true,"local":"images/detail/0559-2.webp","localAvailable":true}]}